  - [1mNode's built-in test runner ([38;5;153mnode --test[39m)[0m — zero dependencies, ships with Node 18+. Adds a [38;5;153mtest/[39m dir and a [38;5;153m"test"[39m
    script. Costs nothing in install weight; requires the module use ES modules or a small dual-export so Node can load
